# ---------------- Configurable thresholds ----------------
# Every one of these used to be a hardcoded module constant. They now live in
# a mutable `settings` dict (protected by settings_lock) that the frontend
# can read/update via GET/POST /settings. Each detection loop takes a
# snapshot of this dict once per frame, so changes from the Settings screen
# take effect on the very next frame with no restart needed.
